  - m_Id: 218534311981056
    m_Localized: "<b>1. Acceptance of Terms</b>  \r\nBy downloading, accessing, or
      using the MuseoAR mobile application (the \u201CApp\u201D), you agree to be
      bound by these Terms and Conditions.  \r\nIf you do not agree to these terms,
      please do not use the App.  \r\n\r\n<b>2. Description of the Service</b>  \r\nMuseoAR
      is an augmented reality (AR) mobile application designed to enhance the museum
      experience by providing interactive, multilingual information on artifacts
      and exhibits.  \r\nThe App is for informational and educational purposes only. 
      \r\n\r\n<b>3. User Obligations</b>  \r\nYou agree to use the App in accordance
      with all applicable laws and regulations.  \r\nYou shall not misuse the App
      in any way that may harm its functionality or access rights for other users. 
      \r\n\r\n<b>4. Intellectual Property Rights</b>  \r\nAll content available within
      the App, including but not limited to text, graphics, images, software, and
      multimedia, is the intellectual property of MuseoAR or its licensors.  \r\nYou
      are not permitted to modify, distribute, reproduce, or use any of the content
      for commercial purposes without prior written consent.  \r\n\r\n<b>5. Privacy
      and Data Collection</b>  \r\nThe App may collect data such as language preferences,
      scan history, and device information for the purpose of enhancing user experience. 
      \r\nFor detailed information, refer to our Privacy Policy.  \r\nWe are committed
      to protecting your personal information and ensuring it is used responsibly. 
      \r\n\r\n<b>6. Limitations of Liability</b>  \r\nMuseoAR and its developers
      shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential
      damages resulting from the use or inability to use the App.  \r\nThe App may
      include links to third-party websites for additional resources.  \r\nMuseoAR
      is not responsible for the content or availability of these external sites. 
      \r\n\r\n<b>7. Updates and Modifications</b>  \r\nWe may update or modify the
      App and these Terms and Conditions at any time without prior notice.  \r\nBy
      continuing to use the App after changes are posted, you accept those changes. 
      \r\nWe recommend checking this page periodically for updates.  \r\n\r\n<b>8.
      Termination of Access</b>  \r\nMuseoAR reserves the right to terminate or suspend
      your access to the App without notice for any violation of these Terms.  \r\nUpon
      termination, all rights granted to you under these Terms will cease immediately. 
      \r\n\r\n<b>9. Governing Law</b>  \r\nThese Terms and Conditions are governed
      by and construed in accordance with the laws of Philippines, without regard
      to its conflict of laws principles.  \r\n\r\n<b>10. Contact Information</b> 
      \r\nFor any questions or concerns regarding these Terms and Conditions, please
      contact us at:  \r\nEmail: museoar2024@gmail.com  \r\nAddress: STI Academic
      Center, Alabang-Zapote Road, corner V.Guinto, Las Pi\xF1as, 1740 Metro Manila. 
      \r\n\r\n<b>11. Disclaimers</b>  \r\nThe App is provided on an \"as is\" basis
      without any warranties, express or implied.  \r\nMuseoAR does not guarantee
      that the App will be error-free or uninterrupted.  \r\n\r\n<b>12. User Acknowledgement</b> 
      \r\nBy using the App, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree
      to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.  \r"
